  "properties": {
    "title": "CalCOFI Underway CUFES Fish Eggs — v2026.10.21",
    "description": "Continuous Underway Fish Egg Sampler (CUFES) egg counts (sardine, anchovy, jack mackerel, hake, squid, other) and eggs per cubic metre pumped, from CalCOFI cruises since 1996. Sampling is ongoing; the processed record reaches April 2022 and SWFSC's processing lags its staffing (Ed Weber, 2026-10-14). Squid eggs are Abraliopsis felis, the only squid in the region with pelagic eggs. Source: SWFSC's CSV export of its CalCOFI database (Cufes.csv, linked to the cruise list by CruiseId); until release v2026.10.01 the same records were read from NOAA CoastWatch ERDDAP erdCalCOFIcufes.\n",
    "datetime": null,
    "start_datetime": "1996-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "end_datetime": "2022-12-31T23:59:59Z",
    "created": "2026-10-21T00:00:00Z",
